 # **QwenVL for ComfyUI**
+
+> **Secure Nodes V2:** This sibling uses host-owned canonical Qwen and
+> confined llama.cpp inference with declared, revision- and SHA-pinned public
+> Hugging Face weights. Downloads happen once on demand and are reused from
+> the verified host cache. See [SECURE_CONVERSION.md](SECURE_CONVERSION.md)
+> for the exact compatibility and security boundary; the legacy installation
+> commands below describe the pristine V1 pack.
 
 The ComfyUI-QwenVL custom node integrates the powerful Qwen-VL series of vision-language models (LVLMs) from Alibaba Cloud, including the latest Qwen3-VL and Qwen2.5-VL, plus GGUF backends and text-only Qwen3 support. This advanced node enables seamless multimodal AI capabilities within your ComfyUI workflows, allowing for efficient text generation, image understanding, and video analysis.
 
